cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SimBench.jl
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Please also cite the SimBench dataset and project itself, which this package
  only reads: see https://simbench.net.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Stefan
    family-names: de Lange
repository-code: https://github.com/langestefan/SimBench.jl
url: https://langestefan.github.io/SimBench.jl/
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  SimBench.jl reads the SimBench benchmark grid dataset and converts it to
  PowerModels.jl network data. It is a Julia port of the reference
  implementation at https://github.com/e2nIEE/simbench, which targets
  pandapower.
keywords:
  - power-systems
  - power-flow
  - benchmark-grids
  - simbench
  - powermodels
  - julia
